@title In-app checkout payment flow
@subtitle Payments Engineering · Tidewater Grocers · version 2, dated 2026-09-22

# Payment sequence

diagram pay sequence title="Checkout payment"
pay: app "Mobile App" user
pay: api "Checkout API" svc
pay: fraud "Fraud Service" svc
pay: gw "Payment Gateway" ext
pay: ledger "Ledger" store
pay: app -> api : POST /checkout with cart and card token
pay: api -> fraud : score order
pay: fraud --> api : risk score
pay: api -> gw : authorize amount
pay: gw --> api : auth code
pay: api -> ledger : record pending charge
pay: ledger --> api : entry id
pay: api --> app : order confirmed
pay: note api : Alternative branch when the risk score is above 80
pay: api --> app : step-up verification required
pay: note api : The Payment Gateway is not called on this branch

# Latency budget

data latency = Step,p95 budget (ms),Measured p95 (ms); Fraud scoring,120,96; Authorization,450,512; Ledger write,40,31; Total checkout,800,811

table latency

chart bar latency y=p95 budget (ms),Measured p95 (ms) unit=ms labels title="Budget vs measured p95 latency"

# Open issues

!! **Authorization is over budget by 62 ms.** The gateway's us-east endpoint is called from us-west-2.

Next steps:

- Move to the regional endpoint.
- Add a 2 second timeout with one retry.
- Alert when total p95 exceeds 800 ms.
